<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's Peters to hold Tuesday news conference.</title>
<headline>NZ's Peters to hold Tuesday news conference.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand First leader Winston Peters will hold a news conference after his party caucus meets in Wellington on Tuesday, a party spokesman said.</p>
<p>Peters, whose party holds the balance of power, has maintained virtual silence since his election night speech and declined to comment on whether he favours National or Labour as a coalition partner.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
